00:01.040><c>is </c><00:00:01.041><c>not </c><00:00:01.042><c>going </c><00:00:01.043><c>to  </c><00:00:01.044><c>change </c><00:00:01.045><c>the </c><00:00:01.046><c>correlation </c><00:00:01.047><c>coefficient </c><00:00:01.048><c>of  </c><00:00:01.049><c>the </c><00:00:01.050><c>temperature </c><00:00:01.051><c>with </c><00:00:01.052><c>some </c><00:00:01.053><c>other </c><00:00:01.054><c>random  </c><00:00:01.055><c>variable </c><00:00:01.056><c>so </c><00:00:01.057><c>this </c><00:00:01.058><c>is </c><00:00:01.059><c>a </c><00:00:01.060><c>nice </c><00:00:01.061><c>property </c><00:00:01.062><c>of  </c><00:00:01.063><c>the </c><00:00:01.064><c>correlation </c><00:00:01.065><c>coefficient </c><00:00:01.066><c>again </c><00:00:01.067><c>which  </c><00:00:01.068><c>reflects </c><00:00:01.069><c>the </c><00:00:01.070><c>fact </c><00:00:01.071><c>that </c><00:00:01.072><c>it's </c><00:00:01.073><c>dimensions  </c><00:00:01.074><c>less </c><00:00:01.075><c>it </c><00:00:01.076><c>doesn't </c><00:00:01.077><c>have </c><00:00:01.078><c>any </c><00:00:01.079><c>units </c><00:00:01.080><c>of </c><00:00:01.081><c>its  </c><00:00:01.082><c>own </c><00:00:01.083><c>and </c><00:00:01.084><c>it </c><00:00:01.085><c>doesn't </c><00:00:01.086><c>depend </c><00:00:01.087><c>on </c><00:00:01.088><c>what </c><00:00:01.089><c>kinds  </c><00:00:01.090><c>of </c><00:00:01.091><c>Units </c><00:00:01.092><c>we </c><00:00:01.093><c>use </c><00:00:01.094><c>for </c><00:00:01.095><c>each </c><00:00:01.096><c>one </c><00:00:01.097><c>of </c><00:00:01.098><c>the  </c><00:00:01.099><c>random </c><00:00:01.100><c>variables</c>

